  "description": "FastEndpoints command-pipeline logger that times each command and logs its name and property values, redacting sensitive properties (password/secret/token/apikey/pin/...) before they reach stdout. Extracted from three services that had each hand-copied the middleware; two of the copies still logged secrets in plaintext. The redaction list is the central choke point and is extensible at startup.",
